{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/extras/stressed-at-work.png?t=1733337922\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Are you craving an escape from corporate routine, but are bound by its essential income?</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Do you delight in breaking things, but the cost of replacing them is becoming a concern?</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Do you <i>despise</i> your boss, but the constraints of law restrain your violent daydreams?</strong></li></ul><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/extras/mass-destruction.gif?t=1733337922\" /><br><strong>Unleash your pent-up rage in this chaotic sandbox of destruction; optimized for relaxation. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/extras/sue-for-safety-2.gif?t=1733337922\" /> <br>Sue your way to prosperity! Break safety regulations and file lawsuits to earn <i>Star Bucks!</i><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/extras/vending-5.gif?t=1733337922\" />  <br>Spend your <i>Star Bucks</i> on <i>destructive</i> / <i>delicious</i> items to become the <i>ultimate</i> consumer!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/extras/wreck-print.gif?t=1733337922\" />  <br>Turn <i>trash</i> to <i>treasure!</i> Recycling is <i>effortless</i> when every item is crafted from microplastic!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/extras/print-forms-3.gif?t=1733337922\" /><br>Make memorable memos<strong>: send profanity-laden resignation letters to despised supervisors.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/extras/redecorate-2.gif?t=1733337922\" />  <br>Revitalize your surroundings \u2013 if it's not securely anchored, consider it open to relocation.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/extras/replay-2.gif?t=1733337922\" />  <br>Replay all day. Explore randomized environments with a lineup of whimsical characters.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/extras/evening-news-2.gif?t=1733337922\" /><br>Make a News Debut! Our corporate journalist delves into the aftermath of your decisions.</strong><br><br></strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1065270?t=1733337922","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1733337922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1733337922","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1733337922","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features cartoon violence, and references mature subject matter (e.g. verbal and physical violence, drugs, sex, politics, mental illness and unpleasant workplace conditions). We keep it as lighthearted and humorous as we can. Please have your sense of humor handy, and be warned that some of the humor may be considered offensive. It is intended to entertain. Player discretion is advised. "},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1065270/extras/stressed-at-work.png?t=1733337922\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Are you craving an escape from corporate routine, but are bound by its essential income?</str